  "prefLabel": "Per 102.73 Promotion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.73 “Promotion” means the transfer of an employee from one position to another position having a pay band with a higher step 1 rate.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.43); ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15 (from Per 102.44); ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.48); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.63), eff 12-1-25",
